       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SINVINQS.
       AUTHOR.        A. TREUDLER/FRED HAYNES.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  SEPT. 27, 1984.

      *REMARKS.       INVOICE INQUIRY.
      *D* *  * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *D*                                                          *
      *D* S I N V I N Q S                                  AQ1     *
      *D*  THIS PROGRAM IS THE INVOICE INQUIRY PROGRAM.            *
      *D*  THIS SUBPROGRAM BRINGS UP THE INITIAL REQUEST SCREEN.   *
      *D*  THE USER CAN INQUIRE BY :  1) REGISTER NO.              *
      *D*                             2) REGISTER AND ITEM NO.     *
      *D*                             3) INVOICE NUMBER            *
      *D*                             4) PO NUMBER                 *
      *D*                             5) VENDOR CODE               *
      *D*                                                          *
      *D* N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E                 *
      *D*       C A L L S :                                        *
      *D*          1) SINVINQH.SOURCE - INQUIRE AGAINST HEADER     *
      *D*                               DATA.                      *
      *D*          2) SINVINQI.SOURCE - INQUIRE AGAINST ITEMS      *
      *D*                                                          *
      *D* *  * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *C*
      *C* CHANGES
      *C* JUNE 1992  CR KALMAN
      *C* ADDED A 3 CHAR FIELD TO INQ-2 FOR RECEIVER. THIS IS
      *C* NEEDED FOR THE INVOICELESS PO PROJECT. IT LETS THE USER
      *C* KNOW WHAT RECEIVER THE AUTOMATIC INVOICE WAS GENERATED
      *C* FROM.
      *C
      *C  02/21/94   JS BUNGO   #6449
      *C     RECOMPILED TO PICKUP ADDITIONAL FIELDS ADDED TO
      *C     DPORECD HISTORY FILE.  THESE FIELDS WERE ADDED SO
      *C     HISTORY FILES MATCH LIVE FILES.
      *C
      *C  02/06/95   CA ZUBEK
      *C     CHANGED THE FUNCTION KEY LOGIC TO TREAT THE ENTER KEY
      *C     THE SAME AS THE F1 KEY.  IT WILL NOW GO TO THE HEADER
      *C     DATA SCREEN INSTEAD OF DISPLAYING AN ERROR.
      *C
      *C     5/03/95  WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #95-007
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C     SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C
      *C  11/22/95    CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALWAYS DISPLAY CANADIAN CURRENCY CODE
      *C     FOR DUTY INVOICES.  THE PO CURRENCY CODE IS USED
      *C     FOR THIS FIELD, BUT DUTY INVOICES ARE ALWAYS IN
      *C     CANADIAN CURRENCY.
      *C
      *C  05/07/96    CA YODER     REQ #94-005
      *C     ADDED CODE TO CHECK FOR THE INVOICE CURRENCY CODE AND
      *C     DISPLAY IT ON THE SCREEN.  IF THERE IS NO INVOICE
      *C     CURRENCY CODE, JUST USE THE PO CURRENCY AS BEFORE.
      *C
      *C  06/19/96    CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.

